{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_12","type":"agent_message","text":"The clone probes show linked plates and gates, and a released companion replays the attempted actions—including moves that were blocked when recorded. A companion on the purple plate does not keep its gate open.\n\nI’m testing two recorded routes: one companion stops on the lower-left plate, and the other continues toward the target. The controlled avatar will open the purple gate, then move to the central blue plate to let both companions through the lower gate."}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_13","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"cat > probe_solution.py <<'PY'\nfrom probe3 import *\ndef obs(e):\n return [(b.color,b.bbox,b.area) for b in connected_components(e.frame(),min_area=4) if b.color not in (0,5) and 5<b.bbox[0] and b.bbox[2]<60]\ndef run(e):\n entry(e)\n common=[1]*2+[4]*7+[2]*7+[3]*5\n goal=common+[3]*2+[1]*3+[4]*2+[1]*2\n hold=common\n active=[1]*2+[4]*4+[2]*2+[1]*5+[2]*7+[4]\n # At purple after 8 ticks, wait with blocked LEFT rather than leave it.\n active=[1]*2+[4]*4+[2]*2+[3]*5+[2]*2+[4]+[4]*30\n path=goal+[5]+hold+[5]+active\n c=e.clone()\n for i,a in enumerate(path):\n  if c.terminal() or c.levels_completed>2:break\n  safe_step(c,a)\n  if i in (len(goal),len(goal)+1+len(hold)) or i>len(goal)+len(hold)+1 and (i-(len(goal)+len(hold)+2))%4==0: print('tick',i+1,'L',c.levels_completed,obs(c))\n print('FINAL',c.levels_completed,'steps',i+1,'terminal',c.terminal())\n if c.levels_completed>=3: json.dump(path[:i+1],open('level3_two_replay_candidate.json','w'))\nA.run_program('g50t',run)\nPY\npython probe_solution.py\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
